Su-Sudah selesai...

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.170 
Ehem, yah, kira-kira begitulah.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.460 
Meski menyebalkan,
aku benar-benar tertolong.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:22.700 
Jangan sungkan. Kita kan rekan,
wajar kalau saling bantu.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:23.970 
Kamu ini...

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.000 
Puji dan sembah aku.

