Beli pernak-pernik.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.879 
EDISI TERBATAS
GANTUNGAN KUNCI MACARON

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:48.620 
Gantungan kunci macaron.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:54.200 
Youkachan tingginya 193 cm,
tapi dia suka sekali hal-hal yang imut, lo.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:55.700 
Imutnya.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:57.770 
JAM 8 MALAM
DEPAN GERBANG SEKOLAH

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.650 
Baiklah, ayo kita mulai patrolinya!

